    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>any plant belonging to the genus Gentiana, especially G. lutea, the officinal gentian which yields the gentian-root of the pharmacopoeia, used medicinally (OED s.v. gentian; MED s.v. gencia n. with the variant spelling iencian) | gentian, any plant belonging to the genus Gentiana, especially G. lutea, the officinal gentian which yields the gentian-root of the pharmacopoeia (i.e. medicinal use) (OED s.v. gentian)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
